{"id":"n23910-1-7","stage":3,"title":"다행히 · 幸运","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23910-1-7-1","ko":"잃어 버린 줄로만 알았던 지갑을 다행히 찾았구나.","zh":"原来丢失的钱包终于找回来了，真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잃어","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"2","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어","audio":"/audio/80e252ade1cdc2c9f9de.mp3"}},{"text":"버린","meaning":"放弃，舍弃，放手","explanation":"버리다：放弃，舍弃，放手；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65570","senseId":"4","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버린","audio":"/audio/275ec463ccc1efd12ca0.mp3"}},{"text":"줄로만","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄로만","audio":"/audio/fbf36267a43ff14ab97a.mp3"}},{"text":"알았던","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았던","audio":"/audio/3c3f8542906a99188b7e.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑을","audio":"/audio/5da093412be3fce76db0.mp3"}},{"text":"다행히","meaning":"幸运，万幸，走运","explanation":"다행히：幸运，万幸，走运","readings":[{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23910","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았구나.","meaning":"取回，找回","explanation":"찾다：取回，找回；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"4","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았구나","audio":"/audio/4ca6003b586e68eb459c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"原本拥有或享受到的东西被抢走或不再拥有。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"放弃，舍弃，放手","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"65570","definition":"不再继续之前做的事情或职业。","pronunciation":["버리다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"7b75f0048465d767","term":"다행히","zh":"幸运，万幸，走运","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3","entryId":"23910","definition":"意外地运气好地。","pronunciation":["다행히"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"取回，找回","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"曾经失去、被夺走、寄存的或借出的东西再次收回。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d012590025d102982eb1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23910-1-7-2","ko":"응, 누군가가 내 지갑을 경찰서에 맡겨 놓았더라고.","zh":"嗯，好像是有人把我的钱包交到了警察局那里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"누군가가","meaning":"谁，某某，有人","explanation":"누구：谁，某某，有人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"3","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누군가가","audio":"/audio/e1e710c41424ee8b5193.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑을","audio":"/audio/5da093412be3fce76db0.mp3"}},{"text":"경찰서에","meaning":"警察署，警察局，公安局","explanation":"경찰서：警察署，警察局，公安局；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"경찰서","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25960","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경찰서에","audio":"/audio/7588c01f419e2650dce2.mp3"}},{"text":"맡겨","meaning":"委托，托付，寄托","explanation":"맡기다：委托，托付，寄托；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맡기다","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64685","senseId":"3","lemma":"맡기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맡겨","audio":"/audio/df5b8ee880e7d1ad11bd.mp3"}},{"text":"놓았더라고.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓았더라고","audio":"/audio/533b62ff8aa3fddca33e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁，某某，有人","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指无须透露姓名的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"d7c352449c7960ec","term":"경찰서","zh":"警察署，警察局，公安局","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3","entryId":"25960","definition":"负责一个地区的公安工作的官厅。","pronunciation":["경ː찰써"]},{"id":"e2fc4d9a742ac29a","term":"맡기다","zh":"委托，托付，寄托","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3","entryId":"64685","definition":"将所有的东西放在特定场所或交给他人保管。","pronunciation":["맏끼다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8eb4cbe95a8b0ee8bac4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.245,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23910","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7251,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["原来丢失的钱包终于找回来了，真是太好了。","嗯，好像是有人把我的钱包交到了警察局那里。","你经常去浴场吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["原来丢失的钱包终于找回来了，真是太好了。","嗯，好像是有人把我的钱包交到了警察局那里。","你经常去浴场吗？"],"answer":1}]}
